<title>INDIA: Yield on Indian 91-day t-bill falls to 6.48 pct.</title>
<headline>Yield on Indian 91-day t-bill falls to 6.48 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said on Friday it raised the cut-off price at its weekly auction of 91-day treasury bills to 98.41 rupees from 98.23.</p>
<p>Dealers said the yield dropped to 6.48 percent from 7.23.  </p>
